   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking people to repeat",
     "texto": [
      "**Tolong ulangi lagi** means \"please, repeat once more\". **Bisa mengeja nama Anda?** asks whether the other person can spell their name. To ask someone to speak slowly, say: **Tolong bicara pelan-pelan**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying goodbye",
     "texto": [
      "**Sampai jumpa** means \"see you later\" or \"see you around\"; **sampai besok**, \"see you tomorrow\". **Selamat tidur** is said when someone is going to bed; it is not a general goodbye."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
